// AppLocker Prevented Application or Script from Running | T1059.001, T1059.003, T1059.005, T1059.006, T1059.007, T1204.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/applocker/win_applocker_application_was_prevented_from_running.yml
(winlog.channel:("Microsoft\-Windows\-AppLocker\/MSI and Script" OR "Microsoft\-Windows\-AppLocker\/EXE and DLL" OR "Microsoft\-Windows\-AppLocker\/Packaged app\-Deployment" OR "Microsoft\-Windows\-AppLocker\/Packaged app\-Execution")) AND (event.code:(8004 OR 8007 OR 8022 OR 8025))
